GET http://localhost:18080/health

### Create a real mixed workflow: static inputs, parallel delay/notification branches
# @name createRealWorkflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"Real order API capability demo",
  "tasks":[
    {"taskId":"check","name":"Check orders","type":"HTTP_REQUEST","config":{"method":"GET","url":"{{taskDemoUrl}}/orders","timeoutMillis":2000},"dependsOn":[],"maxRetries":2},
    {"taskId":"transform","name":"Select static customer fields","type":"TRANSFORM","config":{"operation":"JSON_SELECT","input":"{\"id\":42,\"email\":\"demo@example.test\",\"internal\":\"omitted\"}","fields":["id","email"]},"dependsOn":["check"],"maxRetries":0},
    {"taskId":"delay","name":"Brief bounded wait","type":"DELAY","config":{"durationMillis":500},"dependsOn":["transform"],"maxRetries":0},
    {"taskId":"notify","name":"Notify with static body","type":"HTTP_REQUEST","config":{"method":"POST","url":"{{taskDemoUrl}}/notify","timeoutMillis":2000,"contentType":"application/json","body":"{\"status\":\"READY\"}"},"dependsOn":["transform"],"maxRetries":2}
  ]
}

### Execute separately
# @name executeRealWorkflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{createRealWorkflow.response.body.$.id}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Real capability execution"}

### Inspect types, statuses and retry counts; repeat until COMPLETE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{executeRealWorkflow.response.body.$.id}}

### Create controlled HTTP 500 failure
# @name createHttpFailure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Canonical real HTTP failure","tasks":[{"taskId":"httpFailure","name":"realHttpFailure","type":"HTTP_REQUEST","config":{"method":"GET","url":"{{taskDemoUrl}}/fail","timeoutMillis":2000},"dependsOn":[],"maxRetries":2}]}

### Execute failure; attempts 0, 1, 2 should end in DLQ
# @name executeHttpFailure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{createHttpFailure.response.body.$.id}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"HTTP 500 retry and DLQ"}

### Inspect until FAILED / DEAD_LETTERED / retryCount 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{executeHttpFailure.response.body.$.id}}

### Analyze real HTTP failure (Ollama interpretation, deterministic evidence)
# @name analyzeHttpFailure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/runs/{{executeHttpFailure.response.body.$.id}}/analyze-failure
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Index the persisted incident explicitly (safe to repeat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/failure-analyses/{{analyzeHttpFailure.response.body.$.analysisId}}/index
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Retrieve real historical matches (run/analyze/index another failure for a closer match)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/runs/{{executeHttpFailure.response.body.$.id}}/similar-incidents?topK=3

